### Variáveis
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@accessToken = seu-token-aqui
@connectionId = id-da-conexao-aqui

### 1. Listar conexões do usuário
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/connections
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2. Enviar convite para email cadastrado
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/connections
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "partnerEmail": "partner@example.com"
}

### 3. Enviar convite para email não cadastrado
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/connections
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "partnerEmail": "notregistered@example.com"
}

### 4. Aceitar convite
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/connections/{{connectionId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5. Rejeitar convite
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/connections/{{connectionId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6. Cancelar convite
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/connections/{{connectionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Testes de erro

### 7. Enviar convite sem token (deve falhar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/connections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "partnerEmail": "test@example.com"
}

### 8. Enviar convite com email inválido (deve falhar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/connections
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "partnerEmail": "email-invalido"
}

### 9. Aceitar convite com ID inválido (deve falhar)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/connections/invalid-id/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 10. Cancelar convite de outro usuário (deve falhar)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/connections/{{connectionId}}
Authorization: Bearer outro-token

